      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "da714a2e5474",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "eb321878a9ea",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Improved exposure to global workplaces"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2a6950ceeac1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3f919dac762e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Stronger preparation for post-study work visas"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ca5d4a80d9fe",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "34eaf11ff8f3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Higher return on education investment"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3e009afe5a04",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7824a32460a0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As a result, New Zealand continues to be one of the smartest choices for studying abroad."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8eaf047dfbbd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "83133ce5c969",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5e84346091bc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8117da1aca10",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "1. How many hours can international students work in New Zealand now?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2dca0905bc47",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c2e3d9d8c128",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Eligible international students can work "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f0bf4c68374c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "up to 25 hours per week"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1af4ba76ec55",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " during academic terms under the updated rules."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cdf99018d73a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ff6d4d0329c8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "2. When do the new student visa work rights come into effect?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4efc962867f9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "87eb8d52dc6d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The updated work rights apply to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "08ac97d01eb8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "new student visas granted from late 2025 onwards"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4baf682e21ba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Existing students may need to apply for updated conditions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ef8779bd741d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1f5cb17bfda8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "3. Can existing student visa holders increase their work hours?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72e3d506f16c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dfa7edf714c4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. Current students can apply for a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "25d42099f68a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "variation of conditions"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7560aae1962b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "776c79c28122",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "new student visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "016e4ef51ff5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to access increased work hours."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d8fd6de57cac",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "77bb77b117aa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "4. Can exchange or short-term students work in New Zealand?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2e35133dedc8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ec80305efa32",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. Students enrolled in "
        },
        {
          "_key": "75304fb31b64",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "approved exchange or study-abroad programs"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ee7257d7b127",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " may now be eligible for work rights."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "44020f0ea1e2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fa358afa3683",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "5. Are secondary school students allowed to work?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f1f78bfaefa1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "15fd6fea6575",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Senior secondary students may be allowed to work part-time, subject to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "5754579a820d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "parental and school approval"
        },
        {
          "_key": "84234165f1b6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and visa conditions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "758a2a547838",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6e8bb29ed61b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "6. Can students work full-time during holidays?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9ea06faff5e3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "794e108a0159",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. If your visa already allows full-time work during official academic breaks, this benefit remains unchanged."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d7503d916304",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "38e378dcb0a8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "7. Do I need a new visa if I change my course or college?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "15632596f803",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7498daca1e52",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In many cases, yes. Changing your education provider or moving to a lower qualification level may require a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "348203cc838a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "new student visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ede2952468c9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "84507592a9b9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fe663a5ab66e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "8. Will working more hours affect my studies?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "366326956c2a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9bb721f41a31",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Students must still prioritize academics. Working beyond visa limits or neglecting studies can impact visa compliance."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3fef84435cfc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "43e8d043d052",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "9. Are these work rights available for all courses?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "79e70096e4d1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1fd353bc1e2c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Work rights depend on "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a89e501838b7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "course approval, duration, and visa conditions"
        },
        {
          "_key": "796e6ed4fe39",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Always confirm eligibility before applying."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "44d81477e676",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e478aac68bc4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "10. How can Admin Education help with New Zealand student visas?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c197f2dc4092",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1aeddb0c6e12",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Admin Education provides "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ca7c83d86355",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "end-to-end support"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4f0403a0f3c4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", including course selection, visa guidance, work rights advice, and post-study planning."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "deec5cc0e9be",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "884dc38d425d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3c9096c44ca5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "latest changes to student visa work rights in New Zealand"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e5898a39c73a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " clearly reflect a progressive approach to international education. With increased work hours, expanded eligibility, and unchanged holiday benefits, students can now enjoy a healthier balance between earning and learning."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fb08d1aa1b73",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "294265141ade",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "However, understanding visa rules is essential to staying compliant and stress-free."
